 locomotive abilities in 'Snowball fight VR.' It's time to dive headfirst into the snow-covered action and discover the joy of virtual winter adventures like never before!\n\nDon't forget the multiple maps that you can play in such as the hang out area with a TV mirror computer credit AND MORE there is also a space map and more to come soon!!!!!!!!!", "short_description": "Step into the frosty realm of Snowball fight VR, where the magic of virtual reality meets the whimsy of winter wonderlands! In this adrenaline-fueled adventure, you take on the role of a snowman endowed with the agility of a gorilla, ready to conquer the snowy landscapes with thrilling GORILLA TAG locomotive!!!!"}]}, "developer_name": "Jupiter", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/snowballfightvr/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jupiter", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/snowballfightvr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "7289450961135596"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1874493866322319"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1874493866322319"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1711055220, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1874493866322319"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", 